# Agentic loop – ignore heavy / machine-specific / regenerable artifacts.
# Keep only source (*.py, *.sh), docs (*.md, *.tex) and the final reports.

# Python 3.11 venv for cursor-sdk + SDK/node bridge (machine-specific, ~340 MB)
.venv-sdk/
.sdkenv/
bin/

# Caches
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# LaTeX build artifacts (keep .tex/.pdf/.md, drop the rest)
*.aux
*.log
*.out.bak

# Per-case run logs (regenerable, ~109 MB)
logs/
*.out
*.err

# Scratch
work/
e2e_summary.txt

# Spanish docs / generated reports (kept local; English playbook is the committed one)
CONTEXTO_FUTUROS_CASOS.md
LOG_AGENTIC_LOOP_STELLAR.md
INFORME_STELLAR.md
COMMIT_SCRIPTS.md
informe_stellar.tex
informe_stellar.pdf
tablaresultados.tex
auto_fix_reports/
